        </div>
        
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 3rem;" class="story-grid">
            <div>
                <h3>25 Years of Dedication</h3>
                <p>TW Trent English began his pest control career over 25 years ago in Las Vegas, Nevada, where he built <strong>Bite Em Back Pest Control</strong> into one of the most trusted names in the industry. His commitment to humane, effective pest control methods and exceptional customer service earned him recognition as a local expert.</p>
                
                <p>In Las Vegas, Trent became the go-to pest control expert for local news stations, appearing on <strong>KTNV Channel 13</strong> and <strong>ABC13</strong> more than 35 times to educate the public about pest problems, prevention methods, and safe treatment options.</p>
                
                <h3>A Faith-Driven Move</h3>
                <p>When Trent felt called to relocate to Utah County, he brought his decades of expertise to serve Utah families. He founded <strong>Arrow of Light Wildlife & Pest Solutions</strong> with the mission of "removing what blocks your light" — helping families reclaim peace of mind in their homes.</p>
                
                <p>The name "Arrow of Light" reflects Trent's faith-driven approach to business and his commitment to being a guiding light for customers facing pest problems. Every service call is approached with integrity, expertise, and care for the customer's wellbeing.</p>
            </div>
